# The same running turn at 24 columns, where 2.1.259 keeps the parenthesis and
# drops what is inside it after the elapsed time. Half of the tail survives at
# each of these two widths and never the same half, which is why neither is
# what the spinner is recognised by.
print ● Finagling… (2s)
print ────────────────────────
print ❯
print ────────────────────────
print   ⏵⏵ auto mode on
sleep 600000
